OL,3,GNEWSAM65 toll idea not serious, says
OL,4,AReform councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has claimed he
OL,7,Fwas not serious about his idea for a
OL,8,Ftoll on the M65 after it was criticised
OL,9,Fas "bonkers".
OL,11,FBurnley Council's Joel Tetlow had
OL,12,Fsuggested a toll between 50p and #1 to
OL,13,Faccess the council-managed stretch of
OL,14,Fthe M65 from junction 10 at Burnley and
OL,15,Fjunction 14 at Colne.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
