OL,3,GNEWSAM65 toll idea not serious, says
OL,4,AReform councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after his idea was met with
OL,7,Foutrage, Tetlow told the Local
OL,8,FDemocracy Reporting Service that it was
OL,9,Fto merely spark a discussion about who
OL,10,Fshould end up paying for the #15
OL,11,Fmillion drainage work on the commuter
OL,12,Froute.
OL,14,FThe six-mile section of the M65 is the
OL,15,Fresponsibility of Lancashire County
OL,16,FCouncil, while the rest is maintained
OL,17,Fby National Highways.
